# Paths the Vercel CLI does not upload (`vercel deploy` from CI builds on Vercel from this filtered tree).
# EVERY pattern is anchored with a leading `/`: an unanchored `art` matched src/explore/art/ at any depth, the remote
# build never saw it and deploys f94c5da + e507b24 went red while CI (full tree) was green. Nothing under src/, public/,
# api/ or scripts/ may ever be ignored. .githooks/pre-push (scripts/vercel-tree-gate.sh) enforces both before a push.
/node_modules
/dist
/progress
/sources
/art
/docs
/.git
/ios
/android
/dist-native
/.native-build
